# TaskMaster: A Collaborative Task Tracking System

## Description
TaskMaster is a backend system developed using Spring Boot for tracking and managing tasks in a collaborative team environment. It supports task CRUD operations, user authentication, team/project management, and real-time communication extensions.

## Tech Stack
- Java 17
- Spring Boot
- MySQL
- Spring Security (JWT)
- WebSockets (optional)
- OpenAI (optional)

## Features
User registration, login, profile management
Task creation, assignment, completion
Team/project collaboration
Comments and attachments
JWT-based authentication
RESTful API
Optional: WebSocket notifications, AI integration

## Getting Started

### Prerequisites
- Java 17
